    <content:encoded>&lt;img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-4852" src="https://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/flown-in-1.png" alt="flown-in" width="2208" height="1558" /&gt;

We added a nice line across by flying &lt;a href="http://www.flyingsummers.com/2007/08/05/success/"&gt;west to east across the country&lt;/a&gt; and as of June 2022 we have &lt;a href="http://www.flyingsummers.com/crossing-the-country"&gt;crossed the country forty-one&lt;/a&gt;. We need to fly to Miami for a winter break.

(This clever map is created by &lt;a title="map" href="https://www.mapchart.net/usa.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;these friendly people&lt;/a&gt;.)

